IT’S MADE OUT
OF S&H GREEN STAMPS.

493
00:17:52,272 --> 00:17:54,207
THANKS A LOT,
VI.

494
00:17:59,480 --> 00:18:00,547
[WIND HOWLING]

495
00:18:00,547 --> 00:18:02,950
TONIGHT, FROM THE CRYPT,
I WANT TO BURY

496
00:18:02,950 --> 00:18:05,885
A LIGHTHOUSE KEEPER.
[LAUGHS]

497
00:18:08,488 --> 00:18:10,423
SESSIONS PRESENTS--
"SOFT ROCK CLASSICS."

498
00:18:10,423 --> 00:18:11,492
LEO SAYER.

499
00:18:11,492 --> 00:18:12,758
♪ WHEN I NEED LOVE ♪

500
00:18:12,758 --> 00:18:13,793
ANNE MURRAY.

501
00:18:13,793 --> 00:18:14,828
