503
00:18:15,928 --> 00:18:17,832
THEY’RE SENDING
THE GOWN TOMORROW.

504
00:18:17,832 --> 00:18:19,900
OH, YOU’RE GONNA LOVE IT,
TOM.

505
00:18:19,900 --> 00:18:22,268
OH. I WAS SUPPOSED
TO SEE ABOUT A TIE FOR DAD,

506
00:18:22,268 --> 00:18:24,672
AND I FORGOT.

507
00:18:24,672 --> 00:18:27,307
I’LL BE SO GLAD WHEN THIS
WHOLE THING’S OVER WITH.

508
00:18:27,307 --> 00:18:28,508
WON’T YOU?

509
00:18:28,508 --> 00:18:30,177
