SHUT UP.

510
00:18:30,177 --> 00:18:32,245
IT’LL ONLY BE A WEEK MORE.

511
00:18:32,245 --> 00:18:33,780
WE CAN WAIT THAT LONG,
CAN’T WE?

512
00:18:33,780 --> 00:18:35,615
NO.
I WANNA KILL YA NOW.

513
00:18:40,353 --> 00:18:42,957
WAIT A MINUTE.
DIDN’T VI DIE IN PUMPS,

514
00:18:42,957 --> 00:18:44,190
AND SHE’S BACK--
SHE’S BAREFOOTED.

515
00:18:44,190 --> 00:18:45,425
♪♪ [THEREMIN]

516
00:18:45,425 --> 00:18:47,760
UH, HONEY, ARE YOU
CARRYING A POCKET THEREMIN?

517
00:18:47,760 --> 00:18:49,963
I LOVE YOU SO MUCH,
TOM.

518
00:18:49,963 --> 00:18:51,632
YOU STILL LOVE ME,
DON’T YOU?

519
00:18:51,632 --> 00:18:53,200
HMM?

520
00:18:53,200 --> 00:18:56,135
[MUMBLES]
MY BRACES.

521
00:18:58,738 --> 00:18:59,740
HMM.

522
00:18:59,740 --> 00:19:01,007
WAIT A MINUTE.

523
00:19:01,007 --> 00:19:02,475
WERE YOU JUST WALKING
ON ALL FOURS?

524
00:19:02,475 --> 00:19:06,447
LOOK.

525
00:19:06,447 --> 00:19:09,048
DON’T YOU SEE ANYTHING?

526
00:19:09,048 --> 00:19:10,583
LIKE WHAT?
THERE’S NOTHING TO SEE.

527
00:19:10,583 --> 00:19:11,785
RIGHT THERE.

528
00:19:11,785 --> 00:19:13,953
