WHY?

530
00:19:18,192 --> 00:19:21,628
THERE’S NOTHING THERE.

531
00:19:21,628 --> 00:19:23,597
WHAT’S THE MATTER?

532
00:19:23,597 --> 00:19:25,565
WELL, ARE YOU A FEEB?

533
00:19:25,565 --> 00:19:27,367
MEG...

534
00:19:27,367 --> 00:19:29,435
I’VE GOTTA
GET OUT OF HERE.

535
00:19:29,435 --> 00:19:30,503
RIGHT AWAY.

536
00:19:30,503 --> 00:19:31,572
I NEED AIR.

537
00:19:31,572 --> 00:19:33,440
MEG.
LET’S ELOPE.

538
00:19:33,440 --> 00:19:35,508
WE CAN CATCH A BOAT
TO THE MAIN LAND, AND...

539
00:19:35,508 --> 00:19:36,910
BE MARRIED THIS AFTERNOON.

540
00:19:36,910 --> 00:19:38,078
WHAT ABOUT THE WEDDING?

541
00:19:38,078 --> 00:19:40,313
LOOK. I WAS NEVER
FOR A BIG DEAL, ANYWAY.

542
00:19:40,313 --> 00:19:42,182
I ONLY AGREED TO IT ’CAUSE
YOU WANTED IT.

543
00:19:42,182 --> 00:19:44,183
DOESN’T IT MATTER
THAT I STILL WANT IT?

544
00:19:44,183 --> 00:19:45,252
PLEASE, MEG.
PLEASE.

545
00:19:45,252 --> 00:19:46,287
DO THIS FOR ME.

546
00:19:46,287 --> 00:19:48,655
JUST GO AWAY
WITH ME RIGHT NOW.

547
00:19:48,655 --> 00:19:51,225
I TOLD YOU.
THAT’S IMPOSSIBLE.

548
00:19:51,225 --> 00:19:54,595
PLUS, MY MOTHER AND FATHER
WOULD THINK...

549
00:19:54,595 --> 00:19:56,062
THEN I’LL HAVE
TO GO BY MYSELF.

550
00:19:56,062 --> 00:19:57,397
ELOPE BY YOURSELF?

551
00:19:57,397 --> 00:20:01,335
WHAT ABOUT THE WEDDING?

552
00:20:01,335 --> 00:20:03,837
WHAT ABOUT IT,
MEG?

553
00:20:03,837 --> 00:20:05,305
