OVER THE THRESHOLD?

559
00:20:11,978 --> 00:20:14,380
[GRUMBLES]
MEN.

560
00:20:20,587 --> 00:20:24,190
SAM?

561
00:20:24,190 --> 00:20:25,825
SESSIONS PRESENTS--
DAVID SOUL.

562
00:20:25,825 --> 00:20:27,427
♪ DON’T GIVE
UP ON US BA-- ♪

563
00:20:27,427 --> 00:20:28,595
AND NOW,
I WILL PERFORM

564
00:20:28,595 --> 00:20:30,697
THE GREATEST OF ALL
MAGIC ACCOMPLISHMENTS

565
00:20:30,697 --> 00:20:32,598
