OH. I’M WAITIN’
FOR THE WAITRESS.

572
00:20:42,375 --> 00:20:44,678
DON’T YOU WANNA SEE
THE SECRET CABINET?

573
00:20:44,678 --> 00:20:46,813
OH. SURE I DO.
