FIGHTING WITH YOUR SISTER?

593
00:21:24,217 --> 00:21:25,718
MEG’S MAD AT ME,
YOU KNOW.

594
00:21:25,718 --> 00:21:26,953
SHE’LL GET OVER IT.

595
00:21:26,953 --> 00:21:28,722
BESIDES,
IF SHE DOESN’T,

596
00:21:28,722 --> 00:21:30,223
