YOU HAVE TO HELP ME.

675
00:23:33,780 --> 00:23:35,382
OH.
THERE HE GOES AGAIN.

676
00:23:35,382 --> 00:23:36,650
BOY,
THAT MAKES ME ANGRY.

677
00:23:36,650 --> 00:23:37,650
